Package: monopolyAtlas
Type: Package
Title: Transcriptomic Monopoly Analysis Framework
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Fangyuan", "Liu", email = "liufangyuan1989@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Compute transcriptomic monopoly metrics (TMI, top-share, Gini, HHI) from
    bulk and single-cell expression matrices, query the pan-cancer monopoly atlas
    (74 monopoly genes x 32 cancer types), and reproduce the visual language of the
    transcriptomic-monopoly manuscript (STATE/CARRIER/WHERE/WHICH/MEANING/BOUNDARY).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/liufangyuan0613/monopolyAtlas
BugReports: https://github.com/liufangyuan0613/monopolyAtlas/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: ggplot2, stats, utils, methods, Matrix, data.table, rlang
Suggests: ComplexHeatmap, shiny, plotly, DT, testthat (>= 3.0), knitr, rmarkdown, pkgdown, rcmdcheck
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
